+# 6. Changes proposed on 12 Oct 2026
+
+These come from the review of the first SDK implementation, [push-chain-sdk PR #291](https://github.com/pushchain/push-chain-sdk/pull/291), which runs against the v5 contracts on Donut. Sections 0 to 5 above are left exactly as they were. Where an entry here differs from them, the entry here is the current one. The SDK side of each change is on [5. SDK: AGW](https://app.notion.com/p/5-SDK-AGW-3e9188aea7f481cf8e8de324956549b9?pvs=21) (page 5), section 6.
